              <span>
                <strong>Default</strong>
                <span>Each search tab closes after 4 seconds, before the next opens.</span>
              </span>
            </p>
            <p class="delay-option">
              <span class="delay-option-icon delay-option-random" aria-hidden="true">R</span>
              <span>
                <strong>Random</strong>
                <span>Each tab stays open for a random 15.1–21 seconds, then closes before the next opens.</span>
